Before planning or editing, read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root and the
closest nested `AGENTS.md` for the target files.

`AGENTS.md` is the single source of truth for this project. Do not duplicate,
weaken, or replace its page planning, shared-component reuse, security,
localization, or verification rules. If instructions conflict, apply the
closest `AGENTS.md` and report the conflict.
